      "notes": "The API sends the usual staff and customer messages for this event (consent, quiet hours and language are handled there). Safe to repeat. Add your own steps (a Telegram group post, a Google Sheet row) between \"Signature valid?\" and this node, switching on {{ $json.event.name }}.",
      "id": "ce7316cd-db10-5f4e-9b3e-f71d2ce40ce7"
